{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "dc4ad3edd7533e995adccefdac5e912055192ef0c6c5dc8a8226c5d195282936", "ja": "打ち上げで買い物にきた一同は、周囲の視線\nが気になるという。帰国前に撮影された写真\nが、世界的な音楽雑誌に掲載された影響？\n世界をまたにかけるアイドルになるかもしれ\nないな、と期待するプロデューサーだった。", "zh": "大家来买庆功宴要用的东西时，说很在意周围的目光。\n是在回国前拍摄的照片刊登在世界知名音乐杂志上的影响？\n制作人期待着，她们说不定会成为活跃于世界各地的偶像。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_07_1000_p", "source_sha256": "0c7dd8042ef0649e5f0a5c719f38db8d47b979d69f57fd9d64a631d2ba598391", "ja": "（お披露目公演は大盛況で終わった。観客席と一体に\nなって歌い踊るステージは、大いに盛り上がった！）", "zh": "（首演公演在一片热烈的气氛中圆满结束了。与观众席融为一体、载歌载舞的舞台，气氛十分热烈！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_07_1001_p", "source_sha256": "a5eaf247d5858f4c4f0eb7c51753297a05ab6d24e8f84a4b72da57102d3268fa", "ja": "（そして、今日は打ち上げだと、\n真と歩に呼ばれてきたんだけど……）", "zh": "（然后，真和步叫我来，说今天要举办庆功宴，可是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_07_1002_p", "source_sha256": "a3f809d0e05f61932a310118a4ab20d8ece3a96649f55ac8193356f4a98d0893", "ja": "（今は、歩とエレナと一緒に荷物の番をしながら、\nクレープを買いにいった真たちを待っている……）", "zh": "（现在，我正和步、艾蕾娜一起看着行李，等待去买可丽饼的真她们回来……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_07_1003_018ele", "source_sha256": "c07db2d92288657fd34a9043ea717b7f4d87de81f0d251c4ff851b8a82eb9b40", "ja": "ありがとネ、アユム！\nおかげで、カワイイ服がいーっぱい見つかったヨ！", "zh": "谢谢你，小步！\n多亏了你，我找到了好多好多可爱的衣服哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_07_1004_034ayu", "source_sha256": "e33dd79f3fecc3c623f53a9b6c039701af25dbf08b6db50b4291e13f1e9ac0d7", "ja": "どういたしまして！　エレナは素材がいいからね。\n選んでて、すっごく楽しかったよ！", "zh": "不客气！艾莲娜本身条件就很好嘛。挑选的时候，我也特别开心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_07_1005_034ayu", "source_sha256": "79847f6481e099503845e612ed2abf31a75e57cd9b0a098d0b214f245b2a77fd", "ja": "次は、アタシもカッコいいパンツ買おうかなー。\nあっ！　真とお揃いってのもいいかも！", "zh": "下次我也买条帅气的裤子吧——\n啊！和真买同款也不错！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_07_1006_p", "source_sha256": "2853b4273568e4e39846461ef6e75a5e9403fb6280849a65f74ffadddd0344d3", "ja": "えっ、まだ買うのか？\nもう持ちきれないくらいの荷物なのに……。", "zh": "欸，还要买吗？\n明明行李已经多到快拿不动了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_07_1007_034ayu", "source_sha256": "7c9dda444fbea671651a89e276c92e675754aaacb270926fe1191602f9e165dc", "ja": "何言ってんの、{$P$}！\n次が、大本命！　アタシのおすすめブランドだよ！", "zh": "说什么呢，{$P$}！\n接下来才是重头戏！是我推荐的品牌哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_07_1008_018ele", "source_sha256": "d7f648488c13890d1fb68f01351aeaa9a72d5a20a91a027a263850d97048a0e7", "ja": "ワオ！　アユムのオススメなら、間違いないネ！\nエヘヘ、楽しみだナ～♪", "zh": "哇！既然是步的推荐，就绝对不会错啦！\n嘿嘿，好期待啊～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_07_1009_006mak", "source_sha256": "c7ab861550fe09a0892247a352c212d5e1f107d19eafc18fa7cdc0bc5f1564d1", "ja": "みんな、おまたせーっ！\nカワイイクレープ、買ってきたよー！", "zh": "大家久等啦——！\n我买了可爱的可丽饼回来哦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_07_1010_034ayu", "source_sha256": "58081be4b0218133b1804656e1b005eab4ffb7f4a6f08ff0ad03f7ddd7456d1e", "ja": "サンキュー！　って、真のクレープ、なにそれ！？\nなんでそんなにクリーム山盛りなの！？", "zh": "谢谢！等等，真做的可丽饼，这是什么啊！？\n为什么奶油堆得这么高！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_07_1011_006mak", "source_sha256": "801f79ab79fd66f59ba1dd1e09a824a0f5a813dbd77bbcdd007528782db0590a", "ja": "これ、ホワイトチョコストロベリーホイップのクリーム\n大盛りトッピングだよ！　すごいカワイイよね！", "zh": "这是白巧克力草莓鲜奶油的大份加料哦！是不是特别可爱！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_07_1012_043nor", "source_sha256": "5e7d16cf39be67acb72edaade1d0bd4bb42b2f7ccf1e49f80ccf92c97deb5786", "ja": "はい、これは{$P$}の分！\nアタシらの愛情マシマシレインボークレープだよ！", "zh": "好，这是{$P$}的那份！\n我们爱意加满的彩虹可丽饼哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_07_1013_p", "source_sha256": "cc35eae979bbacb32bdbb8397a8cb09713acda68b4ef21a90d05960727aeee30", "ja": "おっ、クレープの生地が七色だからレインボーか。\nでも色が混ざって、なんだかすごい見た目だな……。", "zh": "哦，原来是因为可丽饼的饼皮有七种颜色，所以才叫彩虹啊。\n不过颜色混在一起，看起来还真是够特别的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_07_1014_018ele", "source_sha256": "16c85af9ccb65c59e11fc9c21211da7da3be7a8c72e881ee9a5e0f472e9e1e51", "ja": "ん～♪　すっごくおいしいネ♪", "zh": "嗯～♪超级好吃呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_07_1015_047sub", "source_sha256": "3c4c316459167a103afedb434da25ca27b4e1d81b61de6e2a62024a9041c69e6", "ja": "うん！　チョコバナナカスタードもすげーうまいぜ！\nのり子のは……えっと、なんだっけ？", "zh": "嗯！巧克力香蕉卡仕达也超好吃的！\n诺莉子的那个……呃，叫什么来着？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_07_1016_043nor", "source_sha256": "87686aa6352a2912d9be39ed855bca560eba1086c3d2483c97e3d6d1ea36f71b", "ja": "もう忘れたの？　ブルーベリーレアチーズだよ。\n昴、アタシのも食べてみる？", "zh": "你已经忘了吗？是蓝莓生奶酪哦。\n昴，要不要也尝尝我的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_07_1017_047sub", "source_sha256": "9e04b9b33976ac77e4963f92ee7044fd1e645d89a998f93b4bb89f7568a9550e", "ja": "えっ、いいのか？", "zh": "咦，可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_07_1018_006mak", "source_sha256": "8fe7e19deaefb7adfeb9880431e576f7b68b89b5a9d3be0834c8d5abd889919c", "ja": "う～ん♪　クリームとチョコの甘さが絶妙だね！\nねえ、歩。歩のもちょっと食べてみたいんだけど……。", "zh": "嗯～♪奶油和巧克力的甜度搭配得恰到好处呢！\n呐，步的那份我也想尝一点……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_07_1019_034ayu", "source_sha256": "be5cb01d7dabd1f67928cf130bf80a9b834048f7eda1db7ce8cb7da797697f1a", "ja": "もちろん！　それじゃ、真のと交換ね！\nさっきから気になってたんだよー。", "zh": "当然可以！那我和真的换着吃吧！\n我刚才就一直很在意呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_07_1020_047sub", "source_sha256": "7e6531edd4568c95b660518a1d1bdb2b4e640107555b2c15dac98af7f3d4621e", "ja": "なあ、{$P$}！\nオレのと交換……ん？", "zh": "喂，{$P$}！\n要不要和我的交换……嗯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_07_1021_p", "source_sha256": "09453ed8544e1e1bc523c5840447a4361f2d1407cce49a271522aa8e575ed90d", "ja": "……どうした、昴？", "zh": "……怎么了，昴？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_07_1022_047sub", "source_sha256": "1ec63141b69dc612e9e45c3c822c78e57f3977ffab1fde342e719c1316218890", "ja": "あのさ、気のせいならいいんだけど……。\nオレたち、なんか見られてない？", "zh": "那个，要是我多心了倒还好……\n总觉得，是不是有人在盯着我们看啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_07_1023_018ele", "source_sha256": "c7b075ca4177cda7c684a0378f723153acaf65d0be1f802b5fc990ba073fdf39", "ja": "そういえば、待ってる時も視線を感じたカモ。\nワタシたちを見てる女の子がいっぱいいたネ。", "zh": "说起来，等着的时候好像也感觉有人在看我们。  \n有好多女孩子在看我们呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_07_1024_043nor", "source_sha256": "443edf042dcab6a8485d10844228946faee229bb1e35e0979a4e9e2b5ebc82c7", "ja": "それって、多分アレのせいかな？\n観光の時に撮られた、ストリートスナップ！", "zh": "那大概是因为那个吧？\n观光时被拍下的街拍照片！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_07_1025_006mak", "source_sha256": "a670b3e0a42012c21ccd4010a19fcd88121a8fa4e41815ee2e3ec0349e767962", "ja": "きっとそうだよ！\nあの雑誌、日本でも人気があるって言ってたから。", "zh": "一定就是那个吧！\n他们说那本杂志在日本也很受欢迎。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_07_1026_047sub", "source_sha256": "6de0a05a115a1888bfe55352e484a000d6922900b1ff9bfde6e139575a703ae5", "ja": "ああ、あれか？　え～っと、アメリカの雑誌の、\nプリティなんとかってコラムに写真が載ったんだっけ？", "zh": "啊，是那个吗？呃——我记得照片登上了美国杂志上一个叫“Pretty什么来着”的专栏，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_07_1027_p", "source_sha256": "2384ccb1137d3659b5da074341249b6ca7c30e9ecd743352d5fc1ea69e7553d2", "ja": "そうそう、アメリカの音楽雑誌の、\n『Pretty girl in NewYork』コラムだな。", "zh": "没错，就是美国音乐杂志的《Pretty girl in NewYork》专栏。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_07_1028_p", "source_sha256": "f3af2bb1acf7f20bb2a128b4d5dedaff35c1d0cb0ff39ceca4e3a7a4c8b327e6", "ja": "たしか今日が翻訳版の発売日だ。日本だけじゃなくて、\n世界各国で出版してるらしいぞ！", "zh": "我记得今天是翻译版的发售日。不仅在日本，听说还会在世界各国出版呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_07_1029_034ayu", "source_sha256": "6364d7bb8cace0b8b1a6c0e445538ea9b3ae4f8f1312565253f4eb56d2c189cc", "ja": "それじゃ……へへっ♪\nこれでアタシ達も、世界的有名人ってヤツ？", "zh": "那就……嘿嘿♪\n这样一来，我们也算是世界知名人士了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_07_1030_034ayu", "source_sha256": "67c22ff07f96e78cdea020231f9d64a9d3e7f5df7005e68e5c7cd755aa89b749", "ja": "いや～、参っちゃうよね～！\n有名人には、プライベートがなくってさー！", "zh": "哎呀～真是伤脑筋呢～！\n当了名人，就没有私人时间了嘛——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_07_1031_006mak", "source_sha256": "15cccaa9f158eeca06ae2330d9d8890d7be5d4d9f4a15147dbaae78d622a3636", "ja": "あはははっ！", "zh": "啊哈哈哈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_07_1032_034ayu", "source_sha256": "15cccaa9f158eeca06ae2330d9d8890d7be5d4d9f4a15147dbaae78d622a3636", "ja": "あはははっ！", "zh": "啊哈哈哈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_07_1033_018ele", "source_sha256": "15cccaa9f158eeca06ae2330d9d8890d7be5d4d9f4a15147dbaae78d622a3636", "ja": "あはははっ！", "zh": "啊哈哈哈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_07_1034_043nor", "source_sha256": "15cccaa9f158eeca06ae2330d9d8890d7be5d4d9f4a15147dbaae78d622a3636", "ja": "あはははっ！", "zh": "啊哈哈哈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
